          "items": [
            "Summary:<br><br>Premium 4 Bedroom, 3.5 Bathroom Villa - Inlet Beach & Lake Powell Nearby, Community Pool & Clubhouse - Sleeps 10!<br><br><br><br>Escape to the serene shores of Inlet Beach, Florida, where luxury and tranquility merge at Narnia Grande Point Villa. Nestled within the exclusive Grande Point community, this premium retreat invites you to unwind in style and comfort. Minutes from pristine beach access and boasting easy connections to Lake Powell, Camp Helen State Park, and the vibrant dining and shopping scene of 30A, this villa is perfectly positioned for your next coastal adventure. Whether you're soaking up the sun by the on-site outdoor pool or exploring the nearby natural beauty, every moment here is an invitation to relax and rejuvenate.<br><br><br><br>Spread across three thoughtfully designed levels, Narnia Grande Point Villa offers a spacious layout ideal for families or groups. The main living area is a bright and inviting space, filled with natural light from south-facing windows. The chef’s kitchen is a culinary dream, featuring granite countertops, stainless steel appliances, and a breakfast bar with seating for four. Gather around the dining table, which comfortably seats eight, or step onto the patio for al fresco relaxation on the bench swing and additional seating. With high-end finishes throughout, this villa blends sophistication with the warmth of a coastal retreat.<br><br><br><br>At Narnia Grande Point Villa, every detail is designed to enhance your stay. From the stunning interiors to the unbeatable location, this home offers the ideal balance of luxury and convenience. Whether you're planning an active vacation filled with exploration or seeking a peaceful escape by the sea, this Inlet Beach gem is your gateway to unforgettable memories. Book your stay today and discover the magic of Narnia Grande Point Villa.<br><br><br><br><br><br>Sleeps 10:<br><br><br><br>Upper Level:<br><br> - King Bedroom: king bed, smart tv, south-facing private patio w/ seating area. (sleeps 2)<br><br> - Hallway Bathroom: large soaking tub & walk-in tile shower, dual vanities. <br><br> - Twin Suite: (1) twin bed (1) twin XL bed, private bathroom with shower/tub combo. (sleeps 2)<br><br><br><br>Main Level:<br><br> - Living Area: sleeper sofa. (sleeps 2)<br><br> - Bathroom: half bathroom<br><br><br><br>Lower Level:<br><br> - Bedroom 3: queen bed w/ powder room and bathroom entry. (sleeps 2)<br><br> - Bedroom 4: queen bed w/ powder room and bathroom entry. (sleeps 2)<br><br> - Bathroom: shower/tub combo, dual vanities<br><br><br><br>Special Unit Notes – Please Read:<br><br> - No Pets/Smoking.<br><br> - Renters must be a minimum of 25 years old.<br><br> - Business and Occupational License #DWE7605320<br><br> - Parking: 4 parking spaces total - 4 outdoor parking spaces outside (no garage access - no on street parking - trailers/boats permitted in driveway ONLY)",
