        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "We enjoyed our stay at the Narnia Grande. There was plenty of room for our family of 6. Fully stocked with everything we needed. Beautifully decorated. The pool was about a 10 minute walk, so we did have to drive. We loved the proximity to Camp Helen.",
        "themes": [
