      },
      {
        "author": "Racquel C.",
        "date": "2025-04-17T18:48:42Z",
        "id": "68015b88faa4777fb0861db1",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "As we entered the neighborhood, my friends and I knew this would be an amazing vacation. Once we were inside the property, playfully called \"Narnia\", all I could hear is everyone saying, \"Oh, this is so beautiful.\" The decor and the overwhelming feeling of comfort made everyone in our group feel at home. Our host, Erin was fantastic!! She was always quick to respond to any questions we had . We I come to 30A, I usually stay at a beach side property BUT Narnia has changed my mind. It was lovely and peaceful to stay in a quiet neighborhood while still having quick access to the beach as it was only an easy10 minute walk. The community pool was also great! We would DEFINITELY stay at Narnia again!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
